- op: discuss  # 2301
  at: '2026-05-30T09:06:42Z'  # 2301
  by: agent  # 2301
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 2301
  clock: 4  # 2301
  nonce: '2301'  # 2301
  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): Root-cause fix is the argparse sentinel: cli.py:6169 sets default=\"slice.json\" (string literal) and cli.py:1377 detects the default by string equality. Switching the default to None (or argparse.SUPPRESS) and substituting the cache path only when args.out is None resolves the bug structurally. Sibling round-trip leak in the same code region: cli.py:1396 collapses hub_threshold=0 to None, which then disappears from SliceQuery.to_dict() (slice.py:230) — see INV-rakot for the broader feature.query echo gap."  # 2301
